      "end_timestamp": "00:38",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps",
      "start_timestamp": "00:39",
      "end_timestamp": "00:48",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I get some relief from blankets. Honestly, a couple of times a week",
      "start_timestamp": "00:49",
      "end_timestamp": "00:56",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Okay have you noticed anything else alongside it?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:58",
      "end_timestamp": "01:01",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "When it starts I tend to get a racing heart as well.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:02",
      "end_timestamp": "01:08",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I was getting to that! The The racing heart? That's been for two weeks.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:22",
      "end_timestamp": "01:30",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:30",
      "end_timestamp": "01:40",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Mild really honestly on and off",
      "start_timestamp": "01:42",
      "end_timestamp": "01:45",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
